This repository holds the source and assets of the certimens.fr public website
— HTML pages, stylesheet, scripts, texts, images and the brand guidelines (the
"Site"). It is the exclusive property of Certimens and is protected by French
intellectual property law and by applicable international conventions.

The Site is published to be read. It is neither free nor open source: publishing
it grants no free, public or implied licence over its content. A public
repository is not a reusable one.

Without asking, you may: read the published site, print it for personal use and
let your browser cache it; index it and show a snippet in search results,
subject to the text-and-data-mining reservation below; quote a short extract,
presented as a quotation and crediting Certimens; link to any page; and, as a
partner or client institution, follow the brand guidelines
(`docs/charte-graphique.md`) strictly insofar as you are presenting the
Certimens service.

Except with Certimens' prior express written permission, you may not: reproduce
or republish the Site or any substantial part of it, anywhere and in any form,
including as a mirror, a publicly accessible archive copy or a derived
repository; modify, adapt, translate it or create derivative works from it, in
particular by reusing its structure, texts or layout for another site; remove or
alter any proprietary notice; use it, in whole or in part, to train, fine-tune
or evaluate a machine learning model, or to build a dataset for that purpose —
the text-and-data-mining exception is expressly reserved against, which operates
as an opt-out under article 4 of Directive (EU) 2019/790 and applies whatever
`robots.txt` allows, that file governing indexing rather than reuse; or present
the Site, or anything derived from it, as coming from Certimens.

The name "Certimens", the logo, its variants in `assets/img/` and the brand
colours identify the company and its service. Nothing here licenses their use.

This licence covers this repository only. It does not cover the Plus Jakarta
